atically, with no copy-paste step in between."}]]}],["$","li","Generate pages from data",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Generate pages from data"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Developed programmatic SEO page systems that create and update large sets of landing pages from structured data, so pages are produced consistently and refreshed when the data changes."}]]}],"$L19","$L1a"]}]}]]}],"$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]}]
